---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure | Type One Den"
  description="Read the Type One Den affiliate disclosure and learn how affiliate relationships are handled on this site."
>
  <main class="bg-[#0F0F0F] py-16 text-[#F5F5F5]" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">
    <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto px-4 space-y-8">
      <header class="space-y-4">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#F472B6]">Affiliate Disclosure</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">How affiliate links work on Type One Den</h1>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">Type One Den participates in affiliate marketing programs. This means some pages may contain links that track referrals and may generate a commission if you click a link and make a purchase or complete another qualifying action.</p>
      </header>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#F472B6] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">FTC disclosure</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">In accordance with the Federal Trade Commission (FTC) guidelines, Type One Den clearly discloses material relationships with brands, merchants, and affiliate networks. If a link is an affiliate link, the site may earn a commission at no additional cost to you.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">What affiliate links are</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">Affiliate links are unique tracking links provided by brands or affiliate networks. When you use one of these links, a cookie or similar tracking technology may be placed on your browser so the merchant can recognize that Type One Den referred you.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">How commissions support the site</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">Commissions help support the time, research, writing, video production, and operating costs involved in running Type One Den. Using affiliate links is one of the ways readers can support the site without paying anything extra.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Honest recommendations only</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">Recommendations are based on honest experience, genuine interest, editorial judgment, and what may be useful to the T1D community. Compensation does not determine whether a product, service, or brand is mentioned. If something is promoted here, it is because it is believed to be relevant, helpful, or worth considering.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Sponsored content and gifted products</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">If Type One Den publishes sponsored content, receives free products, or enters into a paid collaboration, that relationship should be clearly disclosed within the relevant content. Sponsored relationships do not guarantee positive coverage and do not replace independent editorial judgment.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Your responsibility</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">Before purchasing any product or service, you should review the seller&apos;s terms, policies, and current pricing. Product availability, claims, features, and prices can change without notice. You should also evaluate whether a product is appropriate for your health needs, preferences, and medical care plan.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Questions</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">If you have questions about affiliate relationships or disclosures on this site, contact <a href="mailto:hello@typeoneden.com" class="text-[#F472B6] underline decoration-transparent underline-offset-4 transition hover:decoration-current">hello@typeoneden.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
